        <experienceRequired>340</experienceRequired>
        <resourceCostMultiplier>1.28</resourceCostMultiplier>
        <cooldownMultiplier>0.93</cooldownMultiplier>
        <description>Sweep hits for 31. Five cuts of 14 each (101 total). Armor pen improves. Shivering Heart stacks to full reliably.</description>
